{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu-e-p041g","title":"邵畴临终自陈妖言责任与郭诞关系","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu-a-a038b601efe778de4a3b","label":"裴注·会稽邵氏家传","text":"邵畴临终自陈妖言责任与郭诞关系","evidence":["santizhu-q-6e7dd598d1d37dbe1bf2"]}],"participants":[{"person":"santizhu-p0097","role":"临终陈述；引文中“事由于畴”为其自认","evidence":["santizhu-q-6e7dd598d1d37dbe1bf2"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["santizhu-q-6e7dd598d1d37dbe1bf2"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu-q-6e7dd598d1d37dbe1bf2","source_order":[48,41,103],"order":8828}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0097","name":"邵畴","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu-q-6e7dd598d1d37dbe1bf2","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-7b5fb27370763053e3fa","layer":"pei","quote":"临亡，置辞曰：‘畴生长边陲，不闲教道；得以门资，厕身本郡；逾越侪类，位极朝右；不能赞扬盛化，养之以福。今妖讹横兴，干国乱纪；畴以噂沓之语，本非事实；虽家诵人咏，不足有虑。天下重器，而匹夫横议；疾其丑声，不忍闻见；欲含垢藏疾，不彰之翰笔；镇躁归静，使之自息。愚心勤勤，每执斯旨；故诞屈其所是，默以见从；此之为愆，实由于畴。谨不敢逃死，归罪有司；唯乞天鉴，特垂清察","attribution":"裴注·会稽邵氏家传","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":453,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ef864cd2428ef2e1604a","start":103,"end":283,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
